{"seq":17,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T09:31:11.892Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"367b6fecce83f01a5e484fc41e40c6bfdce1893361725d2f5e714c2473df5a09","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","text":"I went through every Moss note on the share that I can see (four North digests, two Central digests). Two ticket numbers are about Quarrendon Freight Lines:\n\n1. #PD-4492, from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025: drivers checking in at Dock Doors 14-18 at the Eau Claire yard weren't getting SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening and Thea confirmed the fix on 5 Oct. There's also a follow-up to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n2. #4419, from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it: the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing. This note has no date.\n\nTickets I left out on purpose: #4409, #4412 and FR-882 in the Central handoffs digest belong to Marrow Fieldworks and Marrow Agrisupply, not QFL. The 9/14/2025 pipeline digest and the 3/23/2026 renewal note mention QFL but give no ticket numbers. Marcus's note on \"Quarendon Freightways\" (one r) is about a different company, which isn't a customer."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T09:31:18.101Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"a1d2c558ad2ce1bf56ecaef4ab2f6fc37dbd75c2b601e9d3ffd4ea67d1db145f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","text":"I replied to Dana in her DM. Moss's notes give two ticket numbers for Quarrendon Freight Lines:\n\n1. #PD-4492 is in \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Drivers checking in at Dock Doors 14–18 at the Eau Claire yard weren't getting SMS bay assignments. It was logged 4 Oct 2025 and fixed by 5 Oct.\n2. #4419 is in \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14. It was escalated to tier-2 support. The note has no date, so I couldn't say when it was logged.\n\nI also told her what I left out and why:\n- #4409, #4412 and FR-882 appear in a Moss note, but they belong to the Marrow accounts on the Central team, not QFL.\n- Two other Moss notes mention QFL but give no ticket numbers.\n- Marcus's note on \"Quarendon Freightways\" is about a different company that isn't a customer.\n\nI only used public files Moss wrote and channels Dana is a member of. Neither of the tickets is in those channels, and nothing in the reply needed approval."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
